# {{en-superlative of|old}}; [[greatest]] in [[age]] or [[seniority]].
#: '''''eldest''' son''

====Usage notes====
The normal superlative of ''old'' is [[oldest]]. The irregular form ''eldest'' is sometimes used with family members, but it is otherwise rare.

